# Secrets for Alfred Skills — credentials for external services
# Fill in your values. Alfred reads this file (read-only) when executing skills.
# This file is for SKILL credentials only, NOT for LLM provider API keys
# (those go in alfred.json).
#
# Never commit this file to version control.

# ── Email / IMAP ──
# For email-reader.SKILL.md
# IMAP_SERVER=imap.gmail.com
# IMAP_PORT=993
# IMAP_USER=your@email.com
# IMAP_PASS=your-app-password

# ── GitHub API ──
# For github-api.SKILL.md
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── Weather API ──
# For weather-api.SKILL.md
# WEATHER_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── External APIs ──
# Add your own service credentials below
# MY_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxx
# MY_API_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxx
